ute Your Plan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598610/extras/ac113bf4041caad3511769d07d5b929e.poster.avif?t=1757938761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598610/extras/ac113bf4041caad3511769d07d5b929e.webm?t=1757938761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598610/extras/ac113bf4041caad3511769d07d5b929e.mp4?t=1757938761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shootout is dangerous, and mistakes will be painful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy, Maintain, and Equip Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598610/extras/9ea521886f2a8e386ded16264c5fd2ab.poster.avif?t=1757938761\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598610/extras/9ea521886f2a8e386ded16264c5fd2ab.webm?t=1757938761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598610/extras/9ea521886f2a8e386ded16264c5fd2ab.mp4?t=1757938761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your loadout with everything you need, from weapons and armor to specialized gadgets and grenades. Everything you need is available to purchase in the store. It’s your job to make true professionals out of ordinary recruits. Train them, pay them, buy gear for them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive Into An Immersive Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pl